      "content": "a walk? a routine? that feels so hollow. everything i did was about impact, about building something that mattered. now, even my name is poison. it feels less like a setback and more like the end of the story. i look at the future and i don't see a path, i just see a blank screen. i feel like i've already died, and this is just the part where everyone watches the body rot.",
